1:["$","main",null,{"className":"detail","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"A printable date-night mystery · exactly two adult players"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Make your next date night a mystery for two."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"lead","children":"Skip the host, costumes and complicated setup. Open a case file, compare what each of you knows and see whether your theories agree."}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What makes a two-player mystery work?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A good mystery date night gives both people a reason to stay involved. Rather than simply reading the same pages, each player should have information the other cannot see at first. The conversation becomes part of the investigation: share a fact, challenge an assumption and decide which detail matters."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["That is the structure of ",["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/trust-fund-affair","children":"The Trust Fund Affair"}],". It is made specifically for two adults, with separate Player A and Player B evidence to compare as the case unfolds."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How the case night works"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Download the case, follow the included Start Here guide, then use separate screens or print selected pages so private evidence remains private. You do not need a host, acting, props, an outside website or a physical kit. Optional hints are included if you get stuck, and the full solution is there when you are ready."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Allow about 75-90 minutes. It is designed as a fictional adult mystery about a fatal fall at a waterfront gala, money, status and conflicting motives. The content is non-graphic."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is it right for your night in?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Choose this case if you want a cooperative, at-home activity where both people have a role. It is not a party game for a large group, and it is not an escape-room venue booking. It is one downloadable case for exactly two people who enjoy evidence, deduction and a deliberate reveal."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"button-row","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"button","href":"https://www.etsy.com/ca/listing/4569212128/printable-escape-room-for-adults-the?utm_source=first_class_lies_site&utm_medium=organic_date_night_guide&utm_campaign=trust_fund_two_player","children":"See The Trust Fund Affair on Etsy"}],["$","$L4",null,{"className":"button button-quiet","href":"/free-mini-mystery","children":"Try the free five-minute mini mystery"}]]}]]}]]}]
